# age files to the tagged recipients, written by
# scripts/make_age_tag_fixtures.py; do not edit. theirs: made by age
# v1.3.2, opened here with the identity from `seed`; ours: made here
# with `seed_number` to every seed's recipient, opened by age's test
# identities (age-tag-witness) with each. A seed's identity is HPKE's
# DeriveKeyPair of its bytes, over P-256 (classic) or MLKEM768-P256 (pq).

